@startuml
actor Pracownik
participant ConsoleMenu
participant RentalApplicationService
participant Inventory
participant IPricingStrategy
participant JsonStoreRepository
participant NotificationService
Pracownik -> ConsoleMenu : wybiera nową rezerwację
ConsoleMenu -> RentalApplicationService : CreateRental(customer, ids, period, strategy, discount)
RentalApplicationService -> Inventory : Find(id) i sprawdź dostępność
Inventory --> RentalApplicationService : Equipment
RentalApplicationService -> IPricingStrategy : Calculate(rate, period)
IPricingStrategy --> RentalApplicationService : cena
RentalApplicationService -> RentalApplicationService : ApplyDiscount(ref total)
RentalApplicationService -> JsonStoreRepository : Save(StoreSnapshot)
JsonStoreRepository --> RentalApplicationService : zapisano
RentalApplicationService -> NotificationService : RentalCreated event
NotificationService --> Pracownik : wpis do dziennika
RentalApplicationService --> ConsoleMenu : Rental / RentalReceipt
@enduml
